# What a real NitrOS-9 Level 1 system shows for the commands os9emu is tested
# on. Booting stops at a TIME prompt; an empty line gets past it, since none of
# these comparisons turn on what the clock says.
#
# Waits are explicit seconds rather than "wait until settled": the CoCo blinks
# its cursor, so the screen never settles.
type
wait 6
snap prompt
type dir
wait 10
snap dir
type free
wait 10
snap free
